      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARCOS (5) gets the nod here after an impressive first-up win, running over the top to score by 0.4L. On the quick turnaround now with CJP on board and he looks an exciting gelding on the rise. Wouldn't surprise to see him sit closer in the run here and bring up back-to-back wins. FLYING MARADONA (1) led and couldn't be caught over this track and trip, winning by 1L with that form already being franked. Pike hops on board now second-up and he should be prominent throughout once again. Well placed to repeat the dose. ARTIE'S STORM (3) was just fair here last start when beaten by 2.8L at this track when first-up. Out in trip looks a good move now and she should be better for the fresh run. Won't be far away. RISING FAME (7) was sound at big odds last start at Pinjarra and she can feature again. LUNA ASCENDING (9) is better than he's shown her past couple and won't be far away.",
